{title: Merry Christmas Bells}

{comment: Intro}
[C][G][G7]

{comment: Verse 1}
Oh, the [C]bells are [C/E]ringing [F]out to[G/C]day
In a [C]joyous [C/E]Christmas [F]kind of [G/C]way.
They’re [F]ringing, [F/A]ringing!
[C]Ding dong [C/G]ding dong!
Merry [G]Christmas Bells![G7]

{comment: Verse 2}
Oh, the [C]sound they [C/E]make is [F]sweet to[G/C]day,
And I [C]hope that [C/E]you can [F]hear them [G/C]play.
They’re [F]ringing, [F/A]ringing!
[C]Ding dong [C/G]ding dong!
Merry [G]Christmas Bells![G7]

{comment: Chorus}
They ring, they sing, they jingle
They ding dong ding
They ring, they sing, they jingle, jingle
Ding Dong
Ding Dong

{comment: D.C. al Coda}

{comment: Coda}
They’re ringing, ringing!
Ding dong ding dong!
Me….rry Christmas Bells…!
Ding Dong!
